---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  lang="en"
  title="Construction All Risks Insurance in Cambodia"
  description="Builder's Risk Insurance protects your project, materials, and equipment while work is in progress."
  quoteHref="#form"
>
  <!-- Page hero -->
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="page-hero-grid">
        <div class="page-hero-copy">
          <nav class="breadcrumb" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
            <a href="/">Home</a>
            <span aria-hidden="true">/</span>
            <a href="/general-insurance-in-cambodia/">General Insurance</a>
            <span aria-hidden="true">/</span>
            <span>Construction All Risks</span>
          </nav>
          <p class="eyebrow eyebrow-light">General Insurance</p>
          <h1>Construction &amp; Builder's Risk Insurance</h1>
          <p class="hero-lead">Building a property in Cambodia comes with many risks — from fire and theft to unexpected damage during construction. Builder's Risk Insurance, also known as Construction Insurance, protects your project, materials, and equipment while work is in progress.</p>
          <div class="hero-ctas">
            <a href="#form" class="btn btn-gold">Get a Quote</a>
            <a href="tel:+85523998018" class="btn btn-outline-light">Call us</a>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="page-hero-visual">
          <img src="/assets/construction-insurance.webp" alt="Engineer with blueprints at a construction site" width="600" height="400" />
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- What's covered -->
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container article-grid">
      <div class="article-copy">
        <p class="eyebrow">Construction All Risks</p>
        <h2>What does Builder's Risk Insurance cover?</h2>
        <p>A builder's risk policy typically covers damage caused by fire, lightning and explosion; theft or vandalism at the job site; and wind or other accidental events during the construction period.</p>
        <p>It's a temporary policy that safeguards the value of your project until construction is complete and the property is ready for occupancy.</p>
        <a href="#form" class="btn btn-gold">Get a Quote</a>
      </div>

      <aside class="peril-card">
        <h3>What's covered</h3>
        <ul class="peril-list">
          <li>Fire, lightning, explosion</li>
          <li>Theft or vandalism at the job site</li>
          <li>Wind and other accidental events during construction</li>
        </ul>
      </aside>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- What's not covered -->
  <section class="section section-cream">
    <div class="container article-grid">
      <div class="article-copy">
        <p class="eyebrow">Know the limits</p>
        <h2>⚠️ What's not covered</h2>
        <p>Standard builder's risk policies usually exclude earthquakes and floods (unless specifically added as endorsements), damage from wind in coastal or high-risk zones, and workplace injuries or accidents.</p>
        <p>You can easily add earthquake or flood riders to your policy — these are often quite affordable and highly recommended depending on your project's location.</p>
        <a href="#form" class="btn btn-gold">Ask About Riders</a>
      </div>

      <aside class="peril-card is-muted">
        <h3>Standard exclusions</h3>
        <ul class="peril-list is-muted">
          <li>Earthquakes &amp; floods (unless endorsed)</li>
          <li>Wind damage in coastal or high-risk zones</li>
          <li>Workplace injuries or accidents</li>
        </ul>
      </aside>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Coverage timeline -->
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <p class="eyebrow">Coverage timeline</p>
      <h2>When should coverage begin and end?</h2>
      <p class="section-lead">Your construction coverage should start before materials are delivered to the site, ensuring full protection during every stage of the build.</p>

      <div class="cov-grid cov-grid-2">
        <article class="cov-card">
          <span class="cov-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></span>
          <span class="cov-tag">Coverage Starts</span>
          <h3>Before materials arrive</h3>
          <p>Coverage begins before materials are delivered to the site, so your project is protected from day one.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="cov-card">
          <span class="cov-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="m4 12 5 5L20 6" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></span>
          <span class="cov-tag">Coverage Ends</span>
          <h3>At completion or transfer</h3>
          <p>Coverage typically ends upon completion or occupancy of the property, sale or transfer to the new owner, or the policy expiration date. Once the building is complete, switch to a homeowner's or commercial property insurance policy for ongoing protection.</p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Why choose AG Cambodia -->
  <section class="section section-cream">
    <div class="container">
      <p class="eyebrow">Why choose AG Cambodia</p>
      <h2>Coverage for every kind of build</h2>
      <p class="section-lead">As an experienced insurance broker in Cambodia since 2006, AG Cambodia works with leading local and international insurers to secure the best builder's risk coverage.</p>

      <div class="cov-grid">
        <article class="cov-card">
          <span class="cov-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M4 21V8l8-5 8 5v13M9 21v-6h6v6M4 21h16" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></span>
          <span class="cov-tag">Developers</span>
          <h3>Developers &amp; Contractors</h3>
          <p>Tailored builder's risk coverage for developers and contractors managing project risk from groundbreaking to handover.</p>
          <a href="#form" class="link-arrow">Get a Quote <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
        </article>
        <article class="cov-card">
          <span class="cov-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M3 21h18M5 21V10l4-2v13M13 21V6l4-2v17M9 13h0M9 17h0" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></span>
          <span class="cov-tag">Residential &amp; Commercial</span>
          <h3>Construction Projects</h3>
          <p>Coverage for residential and commercial construction projects of any scale across Cambodia.</p>
          <a href="#form" class="link-arrow">Get a Quote <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
        </article>
        <article class="cov-card">
          <span class="cov-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M14.7 6.3 17.7 9.3M4 20l1-4 9.5-9.5a1.4 1.4 0 0 1 2 0l1 1a1.4 1.4 0 0 1 0 2L8 19l-4 1Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></span>
          <span class="cov-tag">Renovation</span>
          <h3>Renovation &amp; Extension Works</h3>
          <p>Protection for renovation or extension works, tailored to the scope and duration of your project.</p>
          <a href="#form" class="link-arrow">Get a Quote <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Contact / Quote -->
  <section class="section quote-section" id="form">
    <div class="container quote-grid">
      <div class="quote-copy">
        <p class="eyebrow eyebrow-light">Get a quote</p>
        <h2>Your free Construction Insurance quote within 24 hours</h2>
        <p class="section-lead section-lead-light">Tell us about your project. Compare offers from multiple insurers with clear, professional advice.</p>
        <ul class="check-list check-list-light">
          <li>We compare 15+ insurers to get you the best rate</li>
          <li>Available in French and English</li>
          <li>Officially licensed and registered in Cambodia</li>
          <li>Fully confidential — your request is never spammed</li>
        </ul>
        <div class="quote-cta-row">
          <a href="https://t.me/AGCambodia" class="btn btn-outline-light" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
            <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M21 4 3 11l6 2m12-9-4 16-8-6m0 0 3-2" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg>
            Telegram
          </a>
          <a href="tel:+85523998018" class="btn btn-outline-light">
            <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M6.6 10.8c1.4 2.8 3.8 5.2 6.6 6.6l2.2-2.2c.3-.3.7-.4 1-.2 1.1.4 2.3.6 3.6.6.6 0 1 .4 1 1V20c0 .6-.4 1-1 1C10.9 21 3 13.1 3 3.5c0-.6.4-1 1-1H7.7c.6 0 1 .4 1 1 0 1.3.2 2.5.6 3.6.1.4 0 .8-.2 1L6.6 10.8Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg>
            Call us
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="quote-form-card">
        <p class="quote-form-title">Company &amp; get covered</p>
        <p class="quote-form-sub">Tell us a bit about your project and a broker will call you back within 24 hours.</p>

        <div class="quote-tabs" role="tablist" aria-label="Insurance type">
          <button type="button" class="quote-tab" role="tab" aria-selected="false">Health Insurance</button>
          <button type="button" class="quote-tab" role="tab" aria-selected="false">Vehicle</button>
          <button type="button" class="quote-tab" role="tab" aria-selected="false">Property</button>
          <button type="button" class="quote-tab is-active" role="tab" aria-selected="true">Other</button>
        </div>

        <form id="quote-form" novalidate>
          <div class="form-row">
            <div class="form-field">
              <label for="firstName">First name *</label>
              <input id="firstName" name="firstName" type="text" required autocomplete="given-name" />
            </div>
            <div class="form-field">
              <label for="lastName">Last name *</label>
              <input id="lastName" name="lastName" type="text" required autocomplete="family-name" />
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="form-row">
            <div class="form-field">
              <label for="email">Email *</label>
              <input id="email" name="email" type="email" required autocomplete="email" />
            </div>
            <div class="form-field">
              <label for="phone">Phone / WhatsApp *</label>
              <input id="phone" name="phone" type="tel" required autocomplete="tel" />
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="form-field">
            <label for="message">Message</label>
            <textarea id="message" name="message" rows="4"></textarea>
          </div>
          <button type="submit" class="btn btn-gold btn-block">Request my free quote <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></button>
          <p class="form-note">
            <svg width="13" height="13" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><rect x="5" y="11" width="14" height="9" rx="1.5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"></rect><path d="M8 11V7a4 4 0 0 1 8 0v4" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"></path></svg>
            Your information is 100% confidential
          </p>
          <p class="form-status" id="form-status" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p>
        </form>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
